#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
eva — CLI for EVA (kernel-evolving), the self-evolving local AI agent.

USAGE:
  eva                          Interactive chat REPL
  eva "your message"           One-shot message
  eva <command> [args]         Run a command directly

COMMANDS (also available as slash commands inside the REPL):
  status                       System status (VRAM, model, skills)
  skills                       List skills (core first)
  routines                     List routines
  evolve                       Trigger an evolution cycle
  evolve status                Show evolution state
  evolve stop                  Stop/pause evolution
  dash                         Open evolution dashboard in browser
  model                        Show active model / provider routing
  model set <provider>         Switch inference provider
  log                          Tail daemon API log (last 40 lines)
  memory                       Show recent conversation memory
  new                          Clear conversation (fresh start)
  thoughts                     Show today's thought log
  restart                      Restart EVA daemon
  update                       Pull latest + restart
  telegram                     Guided Telegram channel setup (alias: -c telegram)
  mobile                       Mobile app integration info (placeholder)
  version                      Show version

OPTIONS:
  -h, --help                   Show this help and exit
  -c <channel>                 Configure a channel (e.g. -c telegram)
  --api <url>                  Override API base URL (env: EVA_API)

EXAMPLES:
  eva                          Start interactive chat
  eva "summarise my day"       One-shot prompt
  eva status                   Quick status check
  eva dash                     Open evolution dashboard
  eva -c telegram              Configure Telegram bot
  eva evolve                   Trigger evolution cycle
  eva model set openai         Switch to OpenAI provider
"""

